  "title": "Cherry Dessert",
  "description": "This cherry dessert recipe features a graham cracker crust filled with a creamy, sweet concoction topped with cherry pie filling for an easy-to-make, no-bake pie that is best served chilled.",
  "authors": [
    "Laurie"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-03-31T22:56:43-05:00",
